{
  "_comment": [
    "Single source of truth for every sharded L0 test stage family (x86/SBSA, K8s/Slurm),",
    "one entry per family (not per shard). Consumed by:",
    "  - jenkins/L0_Test.groovy (buildStageConfigsFromSpecs) to build the Jenkins stage maps",
    "  - scripts/test_to_stage_mapping.py to resolve test <-> stage name lookups",
    "Fields: name, arch (\"x86\"|\"SBSA\"), slurm (K8s dispatch if false), platform, testDB, splits,",
    "and optionally gpuCount, nodeCount, runWithSbatch, useClusterDurations (slurm only),",
    "modelExpressSidecar (K8s only). Each field applies identically to every generated shard",
    "\"<name>-<k>\" for k in 1..splits.",
    "\"splits\" is a fallback, not always authoritative: for a stage family whose (testDB,",
    "pre/post-merge phase) isn't shared by any sibling family, both consumers above instead",
    "size \"<name>-<k>\" dynamically from tests/integration/defs/.test_durations (~2h/shard,",
    "see computeDynamicSplitCounts in L0_Test.groovy / _dynamic_split_counts in",
    "test_to_stage_mapping.py). The hardcoded value here is only used when duration data is",
    "unavailable, or when the family shares its (testDB, phase) with siblings distinguished by",
    "stage-name-based filtering (e.g. \"-GptOss-\", \"-Ray-\") that can't be replicated from",
    "config data alone."
  ],
